.venv/
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. Unanchored, `voices/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth — including tts/voices/, which holds the
# eleven reference directories and the contract that says what goes in them.
# Those are source. The ~63 MB Piper .onnx files in ./voices are not.
/voices/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
